age=10&p_sort=YMD_date:D&xcal_useweights=no |access-date=November 4, 2008}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |author=Wallace-Wells, Ben |title=Obama's narrator |date=April 1, 2007 |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2007/04/01/magazine/01axelrod.t.html |newspaper=The New York Times Magazine |access-date=April 13, 2008}}</ref><ref>Mendell (2007), pp. 227–232</ref>

